		line=430,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Just past ten hundred hours.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Around the same time Akari and Soujin arrived in Tenkyo─",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“What is the meaning of this?!”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Empress Hisui slams my desk with both her hands.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As you can plainly see, the Empire will cease to be a sovereign nation as of today.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It will be administered from now on as a territory of the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You're welcome to read this annexation bill from the mainland at your─”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I have not approved of this!”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"She slams the desk once again.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What need have I for approval from a fake Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I proposed it, and the governor-general assented. That's all I need.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ngh...”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"All it took to annex the Empire was the stroke of a pen.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"It might be an unprecedented political crisis for the Imperials, but for our Republic that wages wars all across the globe, it's business as usual.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...How could you bring yourself to deceive others so easily?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“We swore to each other! That until Onii-sama returns, we would protect Tenkyo hand-in-hand!”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“And yet you... you─!”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Speaking of your Onii-sama, our forces in Iseya confirmed that he's alive.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“He truly is alive?!”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Kanami exclaims in astonishment as she leans forward across my desk.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Sure is.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And it only cost us two thousand casualties to confirm it.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I see that you attempted to apprehend Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I just wanted to escort him back to Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Kanami directs a pointed gaze at me.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“And where might Onii-sama be right now?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We have confirmation that he was in Iseya eight days earlier.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But he wasn't there anymore when our second assault element secured Iseya three days ago.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now, where could he have run off to?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“He is on his way here.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama would never run away.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ehehee, I'll bet.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You would do well to watch your back.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama will not be so quick to forgive the Republican Army.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“And especially not the traitor who commands it.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My, I can't wait...”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Suddenly, a sharp ringing echoes deep inside my skull.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What was that sound?”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"My eyes are drawn to the window, and there, I spot a strange pattern of light criss-crossing the snow clouds covering the sky.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"An inexplicable chill runs down my spine at the sight.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Is this magicks at work?",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa & Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ngh?!” “Aargh?!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"A splitting pain runs through my head.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Unable to remain standing, I collapse to my knees with my hands on the windowsill.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Out of the corner of my eye, I spot Kanami crouched down on the ground with her hands on her head.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"I have a really, really bad feeling about whatever is going on right now.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Gritting my teeth at my headache, I call the Intelligence Division on my phone.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"No answer.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
